{title: Ancient Spirits}

Ancient spirit of the land
Please help us to understand
How to join each other hand in hand
To come together and take a stand

Pre chorus:
You were here before we came along
You'll be here long after we are gone
I give thanks for your sacred blessings
And I offer you this song

Chorus
I am opening
I am honouring
I am listening
And I am healing
Spirits hear my prayer
Please make me aware
How to take good care
Of the land

Ancient spirit of the air
Let me show you that I really care
You're the breath of life that we all share
And you carry all our spoken prayers

Pre chorus

Chorus
...how to take good care of the air

Spirit of the rivers, lakes and seas
Flowing onwards with such grace and ease
Wash away our sorrows and disease
And impart your wisdom to us please

Pre chorus

Chorus
...how to take good care of the water

Ancient spirit of the fire
Flaming passion of our heart's desire
You illuminate, warm and inspire
Each generation and you never tire

Pre chorus

Chorus
...how to take good care of the fire

Chorus
...how to take good care of the Earth
